<v John Zimmerman>Alexa, off.
<v John Zimmerman>Alexa，关。

00:52:16.230 --> 00:52:19.250
<v John Zimmerman>[TURKEYS GOBBLING]
<v John Zimmerman>[火鸡的咯咯声]

00:52:19.250 --> 00:52:26.320
<v John Zimmerman>They don't like the station. They knows what I want. Alexa, off. Alexa, play Power 96 radio.
<v John Zimmerman>它们不喜欢这个台。它们知道我想要什么。Alexa，关。Alexa，播放 Power 96 电台。

