<v Alexa>Playing Power 96.
<v Alexa>正在播放 Power 96。

00:52:28.170 --> 00:52:29.620
<v Alexa>[ROCK MUSIC PLAYING]
<v Alexa>[摇滚音乐播放]

00:52:29.620 --> 00:52:33.060
<v John Zimmerman>We'll go classic rock. They've been raised on classic rock.
<v John Zimmerman>我们听经典摇滚。它们是听经典摇滚长大的。

