00:59:34.960 --> 00:59:47.040
<v Ira Glass>Thanks, as always, to our program's confounder, Mr. Torey Malatia. He knows his name pops up in my cell phone every time he calls, but still, he opens every single conversation the same way every single time--
<v Ira Glass>一如既往地感谢我们节目的联合创始人，托雷·马拉蒂亚先生。他知道每次他打电话时他的名字都会在我的手机上弹出，但他依然每次都以同样的方式开始每一场对话——

00:59:47.040 --> 00:59:50.280
<v Dave Phillips>This is Dick Donner calling from Hollywood.
<v Dave Phillips>这是好莱坞的迪克·唐纳打来的。

00:59:50.280 --> 00:59:54.100
<v Ira Glass>I'm Ira Glass. Back next week with more stories of This American Life.
<v Ira Glass>我是艾拉·格拉斯。下周带回更多《美国生活》的故事。

